  "external_validity": "The cases are synthetic: the source records are a frozen table this module emits, not an upstream expert corpus, because the upstream corpora the public-reference builder draws on are not reachable from this environment. This corpus can establish what a decisiveness-aware abstention costs when gold is anchored to the source record rather than to the projections. It cannot establish that extraction drops a coordinate on one side only at any particular rate in public scientific corpora, and it may not be substituted for the public-reference atlas in any external-validity claim.",
